<title>JAPAN: Taiyo Woolen - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Taiyo Woolen - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>  (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.35		vs	    4.16</p>
<p> Operating	 prft 43 mln	  vs   loss 184    mln</p>
<p> Current     loss 132    mln	  vs   loss 372    mln</p>
<p> Net		  prft 8 mln	  vs     loss 6    mln</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 2.17 yen	  vs     loss 1.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Taiyo Woolen Spinning Co Ltd is a medium-size wool spinner specialising in angora wool.</p>
